IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il40-nouns`
IMPORT `il40-s4-saving`
IMPORT `il40-s11-entrenchment`
IMPORT `il40-days`

-- THE SEAT LAYER, row IL-40: the individual to whom the Basic Law is applied (a resident, a person asked to use or receive a notice in a language,
-- a person asked whether a change to the Basic Law was validly made).  "I" is that person.  The Basic Law puts most of its duties on the State; each
-- question is asked as what the text means for the person.  A judgment the text leaves to a law or to someone else is answered NOTHING, never guessed.
-- Each question takes plain inputs and calls the rules in the modules above; no rule is restated here.  Fork switches (F1, F2) default to "declined".

§ `Questions of the individual`

§§ `Section 4: language`

@export What status does the Basic Law give to a language (s 4(a) and (b))?
GIVEN lang IS A `A language` @desc Which language are you asking about?
GIVETH A MAYBE `A status the Basic Law gives to a language`
DECIDE `What status does the Basic Law give to my language` IS
    `the status the Basic Law gives to` lang

@export Is the rule that governs how I may use Arabic before a State institution in an instrument that s 4(b) counts as "law"?
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of enactment` @desc What kind of instrument contains the rule?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the rule on my use of Arabic in an instrument that s 4(b) counts as law` IS
    `s 4(b) counts as law an instrument of the kind` kind

@export Does s 4(c) leave unharmed a status of Arabic that I held before the Basic Law?
GIVEN `it was given in practice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the status given in practice (in fact) before the Basic Law?
      `an enactment gave it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did an enactment (a law, an order or a regulation) give the status?
      `the day it was held` IS A DATE @desc On which day did you hold the status?
      saving IS A `A reading of what s 4(c) saves` @desc Which reading of "a status given in practice"? (Leave "declined" unless you have decided.)
      commencement IS A `A reading of the day the Basic Law commenced` @desc Which day do you take the Basic Law to have commenced? (Leave "declined" unless you have decided.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does s 4(c) leave my status of Arabic unharmed` IS
    `s 4(c) leaves unharmed the status` (`A status of Arabic held before the Basic Law` WITH `it was given in practice` IS `it was given in practice`, `an enactment gave it` IS `an enactment gave it`, `the day it was held` IS `the day it was held`) `, reading what it saves as` saving `and the commencement day as` commencement

§§ `Sections 6, 8, 9 and 10`

@export Does s 6(a) put on the State a duty to endeavour to secure my safety?
GIVEN `the person is Jewish` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you Jewish?
      `the person is a citizen of the State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a citizen of the State of Israel?
      `the person is in distress or in captivity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you in distress or in captivity?
      `because of the person's Jewishness` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it because of your Jewishness?
      `because of the person's citizenship` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it because of your citizenship?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does s 6(a) put on the State a duty to endeavour to secure my safety` IS
    `s 6(a) puts on the State the duty to endeavour to secure the safety of the person` `the person is Jewish` `the person is a citizen of the State` `the person is in distress or in captivity` `because of the person's Jewishness` `because of the person's citizenship`

@export Is this calendar an official calendar of the State (s 8)?
GIVEN calendar IS A `A calendar` @desc Which calendar?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this calendar an official calendar of the State` IS
    `s 8 makes the calendar an official calendar of the State` calendar

@export What standing does s 9 give to this day?
GIVEN day IS A `A day the Basic Law speaks of` @desc Which day?
GIVETH A MAYBE `A standing the Basic Law gives to a day`
DECIDE `What standing does s 9 give to this day` IS
    `the standing s 9 gives to` day

@export Is this one of the fixed days of rest of the State (s 10)?
GIVEN day IS A `A day the Basic Law speaks of` @desc Which day?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this one of the fixed days of rest of the State` IS
    `s 10 makes the day one of the fixed days of rest of the State` day

@export Do I have the right to keep the days of rest on my own Sabbath and festivals (s 10)?
GIVEN `the person is Jewish` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you Jewish?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do I have the right to keep the days of rest on my own Sabbath and festivals` IS
    `s 10 gives the person the right to keep the days of rest on their own Sabbath and festivals` `the person is Jewish`

§§ `Section 11: was a change to the Basic Law made as required?`

@export Was a change to the Basic Law made as s 11 requires?
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of enactment` @desc What kind of enactment made the change?
      votesFor IS A NUMBER @desc How many members of the Knesset voted for it?
      members IS A NUMBER @desc How many members does the Knesset have? (This is not in the Basic Law.)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Was a change to the Basic Law made as s 11 requires` IS
    `s 11 is met by a change made by` kind `adopted with` votesFor `votes of` members `members of the Knesset`
